Please install the Oracle Database 19c Client (64-bit) on L52022, with Oracle Home name OraClient19Home1 and the components Oracle ODBC Driver and Oracle Net Services. 

 When done, the 64-bit ODBC Data Source Administrator (C:\Windows\System32\odbcad32.exe), Drivers tab, must show “Oracle in OraClient19Home1”, version 19.00.00.00.
